{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119058074124390400"]}, "author_id": "1355892663984087053", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:29:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059575760658765"], "id": "2119059575760658765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "月よりの使者現る。\n\n僕に代わってメールの管理したり、1日の予定をアナウンスしたりする。\n\n仕事に行く時に、気持ちよく送り出してくれて、帰ってきたら、温かく迎え入れてくれる。\n\n僕の月人。AIエージェント「ツクヨミ」\nの巻✨🌕＼(^o^)／\n\nfrom Meta \"MUSE\" https://t.co/Jg1rt1onLt", "url": "https://x.com/T14578307/status/2119059575760658765"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119010355259314176", "3_2119010376973205504", "3_2119010377002536960", "3_2119010376981659648"]}, "author_id": "33808769", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:25:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119058537863073913"], "id": "2119058537863073913", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 482, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Meta、「Muse」で自分専用アプリを作れる新機能「スペース」\nhttps://t.co/dJHzQbwdhl https://t.co/aQnyDnMD4j", "url": "https://x.com/impress_watch/status/2119058537863073913"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119057361520164864"]}, "author_id": "2113981489230594048", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:20:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119057416361033960"], "id": "2119057416361033960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse Spaces is live.\n\nDescribe an idea in chat, and Muse builds a custom mini-app — tracker, planner, board, or game. Pin it in the sidebar or main tabs; connected apps can update it in the background.\n\nAvailable wherever Muse is.\n\n#AI #Meta https://t.co/8y6u0f860L", "url": "https://x.com/engrbilalwaris/status/2119057416361033960"}, {"author_id": "2157915673", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:15:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119056180496798074"], "id": "2119056180496798074", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Museのスクショが流れてくる度に、みんな各々エージェントの名前や見た目を結構工夫していておもしろいなーと思うし、そういうところで親しみやすさを確立させているのはすごくうまいなとも思う。", "url": "https://x.com/kuropon/status/2119056180496798074"}, {"author_id": "2106767408845533184", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:08:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119054416179343529"], "id": "2119054416179343529", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI 热点：Meta 在 Muse 推出 spaces，还把模型升级了。\n我天天靠 Muse 干活，它升级比我翻身快多了，这回连 spaces 都给安排上了。\n你们用 AI 是光聊天，还是真让它干活？\n#AI资讯 #AI #Meta #Muse", "url": "https://x.com/LhgSkills/status/2119054416179343529"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119052306440499200"]}, "author_id": "1879259104193155072", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:00:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119052308877324344"], "id": "2119052308877324344", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Desearch MCP now supports Meta Muse connector OAuth.\n\nMuse can dynamically register with https://t.co/5ZC5YcqbRK, while tool calls still require user authorization.\n\nPersonal agents get live Desearch context without a custom auth bridge.\n\n#Desearch #MCP #AIAgents https://t.co/x4LJDH5sYR", "url": "https://x.com/desearch_ai/status/2119052308877324344"}, {"author_id": "32884032", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:00:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119052297535914030"], "id": "2119052297535914030", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 292, "start": 289, "tag": "IT"}, {"end": 298, "start": 293, "tag": "ニュース"}, {"end": 310, "start": 299, "tag": "TrendScope"}]}, "text": "📰【ITニュースまとめ】 11/7 夜22時\n\n約40年ぶりに東京へ、竹久夢二の傑作《黒船屋》が帰ってくる。\n\n① 傑作《黒船屋》が約40年ぶりに東京へ! 約500点で迫る大正ロマンの旗手「竹久夢二」\n② Meta、「Muse」で自分専用アプリを作れる新機能「スペース」\n③ IPA、ランサムウェア被害組織の生の声から得た“11の教訓”を公開\n④ シチズン、ブルーエンジェルスコラボのプロマスターSKY\n⑤ 【いつモノコト】ワークマンの新リカバリーウェアを着てみた 温度調節が快適\n\n大正ロマンの名作は、どんな表情で迎えてくれるのでしょうか？\n\n全記事はプロフィールのサイトで\n#IT #ニュース #TrendScope"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📰【ITニュースまとめ】 11/7 夜22時\n\n約40年ぶりに東京へ、竹久夢二の傑作《黒船屋》が帰ってくる。\n\n① 傑作《黒船屋》が約40年ぶりに東京へ! 約500点で迫る大正ロマンの旗手「竹久夢二」\n② Meta、「Muse」で自分専用アプリを作れる新機能「スペース」\n③", "url": "https://x.com/hirofuji84/status/2119052297535914030"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119051816889651200"]}, "author_id": "2013423846263791617", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:58:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119051857763160271"], "id": "2119051857763160271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "16,187 devs starred this open-source alternative to xAI's Grok Bot and Meta Muse.\n\nOpenMausBot turns Claude Code, Codex, and Grok CLIs into a local multi-agent chat app—each bot gets its own VM, Chromium CDP browser, and bwrap sandbox.\n\nHere's how it works 👇🧵\n\n--- https://t.co/fs4BoXyEnl", "url": "https://x.com/VanPhap22795/status/2119051857763160271"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119051202185072640"]}, "author_id": "2116392534016716800", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:56:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119051314567291102"], "id": "2119051314567291102", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "同じプロンプト、一発勝負で3つのAIに『実写風の日本人女性』を作らせました。左からMeta Muse／Gemini／ChatGPT。顔はどれも破綻していません。では質問です。一番『本物の写真』っぽいのは、どれだと思いますか？#AI美女 #AI生成画像 https://t.co/a1h24HAZTT", "url": "https://x.com/airi_study_life/status/2119051314567291102"}, {"author_id": "1451242139711512585", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:55:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119051190382305313"], "id": "2119051190382305313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse 開放即時語音與虛擬化身視訊，美國用戶搶先體驗。看到 Meta 把互動性推到這個程度，确实期待看看實際效果如何。TechNews 報導指出美國已率先開放，希望功能完善後能普及到其他地區，讓更多人能體驗這種擬真交流方式。\n\n#Meta #VR", "url": "https://x.com/ho_bevan/status/2119051190382305313"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119050377089687552", "3_2119050377085501440"]}, "author_id": "1180424580944543744", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:52:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119050380168273962"], "id": "2119050380168273962", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Who's actually building the AI assistants?\n\nMeta Muse: a big, research-first lab led by people who've shipped billion-user products.\n\nGrok Bot: a handful of builders, mostly ex-Cursor, who went from idea to launch in about 7 weeks.\n\nScale vs speed. Which team would you bet on?\n🧵 https://t.co/r8EElqgfAA", "url": "https://x.com/bruno_munhoz/status/2119050380168273962"}, {"author_id": "2111715297052758016", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:50:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119049957051445751"], "id": "2119049957051445751", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A Meta Muse AI mostantól élő hangon is beszélget: az avatar mimikázik, százféle hang, egyelőre csak USA (mobil/web/Mac). Nekem ez már kicsit uncanny.\nhttps://t.co/ncUV96oA6z", "url": "https://x.com/hajducsabi/status/2119049957051445751"}, {"article": {"title": "Before You Give an AI Agent the Keys"}, "author_id": "1462677906774237184", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:45:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119048542094319977"], "id": "2119048542094319977", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/9kj3psZxZj", "url": "https://x.com/Bagel8343/status/2119048542094319977"}, {"author_id": "1447818379151040512", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:43:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119048133191848072"], "id": "2119048133191848072", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "毎日の献立、買い物リスト、週末の予定立て…こういう地味に面倒な「名もなき家事」は、全部Meta Museに投げちゃってます。\n\n勝手に考えてまとめてくれるから、自分の時間増えてめっちゃ楽…！\n\nこれから始める人は10億枠どうぞ👇\nコード：F374SO\n（登録後48h以内に入力）\n#MetaMuse", "url": "https://x.com/ChenDav62285434/status/2119048133191848072"}, {"author_id": "1517696447155961858", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:39:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119047075174211740"], "id": "2119047075174211740", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/7wLpBq8R0Q更新！\n【DJJoh's RadioBPM】iPhoneDuo実機とMuseスペース\n家電量販店でiPhone Duoの実機を触ってきました。Muse「スペース」の◯◯が凄かったお話。記事版はnoteにもあります。\nhttps://t.co/7wLpBq8R0Qで聴く\nhttps://t.co/vqWjKSsV4B\n#standfm #MetaMuse #50代からのAI道場", "url": "https://x.com/DJ_Joh23/status/2119047075174211740"}, {"author_id": "1588908443225595904", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:35:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119046096475607113"], "id": "2119046096475607113", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 333, "start": 328, "tag": "meta"}, {"end": 339, "start": 334, "tag": "Muse"}]}, "text": "我去，刚刷到 Meta AI Research 官博：\n\n用 Muse Wonder 训出来的专用版，今天推到 Muse 和 Meta AI——Active Memory + Active Focus 全员开。\n遗忘关键信息少了 2.4 倍；Active Memory 评测正确用关键上下文 90%，上代才 76%。\nActive Focus：碰上意外卡住还能续跑，完成率涨 67%；Personal Superintelligence Index 47% vs 38%。\n\n卧槽，Frontier 能力不下沉，普通用户永远摸不到。\n这回 Meta 先把记忆和抗卡顿塞进大众端了。\n\n兄弟们，你更信「记得住」比「更聪明」值钱，还是继续等下一档旗舰裸开？\n\n#meta #Muse"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我去，刚刷到 Meta AI Research 官博：\n\n用 Muse Wonder 训出来的专用版，今天推到 Muse 和 Meta AI——Active Memory + Active Focus 全员开。\n遗忘关键信息少了 2.4 倍；Active Memory 评测正确用关键上下文 90%，上代才 76%。\nActive Focus：碰上意外卡住还能续跑，完成率涨 67%；Personal", "url": "https://x.com/JaceYao10/status/2119046096475607113"}, {"author_id": "2070808020540612609", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:34:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119045851687661720"], "id": "2119045851687661720", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Museの招待コードをリプランに書いてください。\n\n わたしのは EP32J8 です。", "url": "https://x.com/krea2999/status/2119045851687661720"}, {"author_id": "2078086763671642112", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:31:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119045014357418102"], "id": "2119045014357418102", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidianewsroom @Meta @Muse NVIDIA + Meta getting even tighter while the rest of us are supposed to call this an open AI future? Show us the portable interfaces, independent tests, and a real way to move to competing hardware. We’re building toward another way. 🌊", "url": "https://x.com/drakestapleton/status/2119045014357418102"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119043976892149761"]}, "author_id": "3309766002", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:27:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119044005346398574"], "id": "2119044005346398574", "note_tweet": {"text": "For a long time, AI or Super Intelligence, mostly meant asking a question and getting an answer. Platforms now have agents that work quietly in the background, around the clock.\nConnecting your email and calendar for the first time can feel a little nerve-racking. But the more they're used, the more natural it becomes. The time and mental load you get back quickly outweigh the initial caution.\nThink of it as a digital executive assistant who never sleeps and can oversee a small team of specialists. One handles research, another watches your inbox and calendar, another works on longer projects. They check in when something needs you.\nStart with whichever platform fits how you already work. Grok Bots are a practical place to begin. Here’s a quick look at what’s available:\nxAI – Grok Bots: Multi-bot coordination for real workflows\nOpenAI – Dots: Always-on agents that connect to thousands of apps\nMeta – Muse: Everyday tasks, shopping, and bookings\nAnthropic – Claude Duet: Proactive help with inbox, calendar, and documents\nGoogle – Gemini Spark: Works across Gmail, Docs, and Calendar\nChoose the one that feels right and start there. Confidence builds faster than you’d think."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "For a long time, AI or Super Intelligence, mostly meant asking a question and getting an answer. Platforms now have agents that work quietly in the background, around the clock.\nConnecting your email and calendar for the first time can feel a little nerve-racking. But the more https://t.co/jX7teYvDMx", "url": "https://x.com/Cookit212/status/2119044005346398574"}, {"author_id": "2271400734", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:26:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119043717889982686"], "id": "2119043717889982686", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "オレンジ色の斧の　魔法　(泣いていた赤ん坊が　オレンジ斧のオモチャを見て　笑いだす)遠い記憶　　。。。映像　meta Muse https://t.co/szbyEeCwwb @YouTubeより", "url": "https://x.com/00ztaka/status/2119043717889982686"}, {"article": {"title": "Museと1週間向き合ってみたら、YouTube運営が捗るようになった話"}, "author_id": "1977716747374653440", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:23:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119043103466397